### Integration Tests - Complete Workflows through Nginx
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api (routes through Nginx to API Gateway)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### This file demonstrates complete end-to-end workflows
### Run these tests in sequence to verify the entire system works

### WORKFLOW 1: Complete Student Application Process

### Step 1.1: Admin Login to Get Admin Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

# Save admin token from response: YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

### Step 1.2: Admin Creates Student User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

{
  "email": "integration.student@example.com",
  "password": "student123456",
  "nom": "Integration",
  "prenom": "Student",
  "role": "etudiant"
}

### Step 1.3: Student Login to Get Student Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "integration.student@example.com",
  "password": "student123456"
}

# Save student token from response: YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN

### Step 1.4: Student Creates Internship Application
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN

{
  "application_type": "internship",
  "type_specific_data": {
    "company": "Integration Test Corp",
    "position": "Software Developer Intern",
    "duration_months": 6,
    "start_date": "2025-08-01",
    "supervisor_name": "Test Supervisor",
    "supervisor_email": "supervisor@integrationtest.com",
    "description": "Full integration test internship application",
    "requirements": "Testing skills and patience"
  }
}

# Save application ID from response: YOUR_APPLICATION_ID

### Step 1.5: Student Uploads CV Document
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----IntegrationTest123
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN

------IntegrationTest123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="application_id"

YOUR_APPLICATION_ID
------IntegrationTest123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Integration CV
------IntegrationTest123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="integration_cv.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4
1 0 obj
<<
/Type /Catalog
/Pages 2 0 R
>>
endobj
2 0 obj
<<
/Type /Pages
/Kids [3 0 R]
/Count 1
>>
endobj
3 0 obj
<<
/Type /Page
/Parent 2 0 R
/MediaBox [0 0 612 792]
/Contents 4 0 R
>>
endobj
4 0 obj
<<
/Length 44
>>
stream
BT
/F1 12 Tf
72 720 Td
(Integration Test CV) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
xref
0 5
0000000000 65535 f 
0000000009 00000 n 
0000000058 00000 n 
0000000115 00000 n 
0000000204 00000 n 
trailer
<<
/Size 5
/Root 1 0 R
>>
startxref
297
%%EOF
------IntegrationTest123--

